    "description": {
      "value": "You place a psychic lock in a foe's mind that prevents it from a specific action. Choose \"Strike,\" \"Stride,\" \"Cast a Spell,\" or a specific action you know the creature to have (such as \"Breath Weapon\" against a dragon). If the creature attempts that action on its next turn, it must surmount your lock to do so, causing it to take 1d6 mental damage plus your spellcasting ability modifier (with a basic Will save). The target is then temporarily immune for 1 minute."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): The damage increases by 1d6."
    },
